-#
-#  Beiträge overview (Übersicht tab of the Beiträge section). The area holds
-#  no numbers of its own yet; the page names it and links its two lists, the
-#  same two the tabs above and the /fin card show -- each with the small
-#  new-tab companion icon (Fin::LabeledRowsHelper#wsjrdp_newtab_link).

#main
  %h1= t("fin.nav.fees")
  %p.text-muted= t("fin.areas.fees.purpose")
  %ul.list-unstyled
    -# Person-level fee data: :log, the same gate the list itself applies. The
    -# read tier (:finance_read, e.g. an external auditor) is left with the
    -# Ratenpläne, which carry no personal data.
    - if can?(:log, WsjrdpFinAccount)
      %li
        = link_to t("fin.tabs.person_fees"), fin_person_fees_path
        = wsjrdp_newtab_link(fin_person_fees_path)
    %li
      = link_to t("fin.tabs.plans"), wsjrdp_payment_plans_path
      = wsjrdp_newtab_link(wsjrdp_payment_plans_path)
